            "review_title": "Review at Sannie & Jolene",
            "review_text": "Theodore Trinh\nHanoi, Vietnam51 contributions\n0\n\"From hands to heart\" indeed!\nJan 2016 • Couples\nAccidentally found this lovely place when i drove through Ly Nam De street and i was absolutely amazed. If you're looking a hot cup of tea, this is a place to be! Nice tea comes with many options of cakes and cookies. Elegant decorations with good service and good music is an extra point.\nLast but not least, totally expectable prices! It's about 2$ (44.000 in vnd) for tea and 1,5$ (30-35.000 in vnd) for cake and more. \nI recommend this Café for not only for travelers, foreigner who lives in Hanoi but also for local too.\nRead more\nWritten January 31, 2016\nAnthony Le\nHi Thanh,\nThank you for your sweet review. We greatly appreciate it. Every words of that you wrote have made our day better. We look forward to see you again at Sannie and Jolene. Happy New Lunar Year, Thanh :)\nRead more\nWritten February 4, 2016\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
